# Desolation Prowler's ability is an instant-speed activation with no mana: on Bot2's turn 4 Bot1 pays 2 life in response to
# Lightning Bolt, so the Prowler is a 4/4 when the Bolt's 3 damage is dealt and survives (a 2/2 would have died). The pump
# and the damage end in cleanup; the life paid stays paid (18).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Desolation Prowler
Swamp x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Desolation Prowler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Desolation Prowler)
Bot1.Battlefield.Desolation Prowler.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Desolation Prowler.Toughness = 4
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Desolation Prowler.Damage = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Desolation Prowler.Power = 2

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
